  "description": "FEBCAU crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H108 Eu3 O15 Si6,C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.410-3.448 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.63-88.75°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu3{(Ph2SiO)2O}3(THF)6]. Article name explicitly identifies I(I).",
